* Generic 130 nm-class BSIM4 models (NOT a real PDK).
* Good enough to learn agent loops and sizing trends; switch to IHP SG13G2
* (see examples/sg13g2/README.md) for results you can trust.
.model nch nmos level=54 version=4.8 vth0=0.4 toxe=2.5n
.model pch pmos level=54 version=4.8 vth0=-0.4 toxe=2.5n
